OL,3,GNEWSA'Some of Britain's best innovation
OL,4,Ahappens in Rotherham'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor has said "some of the
OL,7,Fbest innovation anywhere in Britain"
OL,8,Fhappens in Rotherham.
OL,10,FJohn Healey was speaking on a visit to
OL,11,Fa global manufacturer in the town where
OL,12,Fhe also met some of the country's first
OL,13,F"AI apprentices".
OL,15,FSince becoming chancellor he has also
OL,16,Fhighlighted the Advanced Manufacturing
OL,17,FPark, built on the site of the Orgreave
OL,18,FColliery and home to big global brands
OL,19,Flike Rolls-Royce and Boeing, as an
OL,20,Fexample of how the north could be
OL,21,Freindustrialised.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
